icorn","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"225":{"n":"Dark Tunnel","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"226":{"n":"Shallow Ford","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"227":{"n":"Great Cavern","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"228":{"n":"Foot Bridge","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"229":{"n":"Narrow Tunnel","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"230":{"n":"","p":0,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"231":{"n":"Inside the Barrow","p":230,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"232":{"n":"north wall","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"233":{"n":"south wall","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"234":{"n":"west wall","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"235":{"n":"east wall","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"236":{"n":"well","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"237":{"n":"wish","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"238":{"n":"water","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"239":{"n":"north wall","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"240":{"n":"west wall","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"241":{"n":"south wall","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"242":{"n":"east wall","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"243":{"n":"","p":0,"c":0,"o":1,"a":0},"244":{"n":"tunnel","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"245":{"n":"bridge","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"246":{"n":"roses","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"247":{"n":"mosses","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"248":{"n":"chasm","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"249":{"n":"","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"250":{"n":"stream","p":249,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},"room":231,"player":4},"intro":" Inside the Barrow                                                    \nZORK II: The Wizard of Frobozz\nCopyright (c) 1981, 1982, 1983 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\nZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\nVersion 48 / Serial number 840904\n \nInside the Barrow\nYou are inside an ancient barrow hidden deep within a dark forest. The barrow opens into a narrow tunnel at its southern end. You can see a faint glow at the far end.\nA strangely familiar brass lantern is lying on the ground.\nA sword of Elvish workmanship is on the ground.\n \n> \n➤\n🎤\nZork 2\nThe Wizard of Frobozz\nBy Infocom\nMap controls\nCenter\n-\n100%\n+\nMaps\nReset Map\n2 rooms / 2 exits / 0 notes\nIN\nUP\nNW\nN\nNE\nW\nInside the Barrow\nE\nSW\nS\nSE\nDOWN\nOUT\nKNOWN ROOMS\nInside the BarrowNarrow Tunnel\nNotes\nParchLock! build 72\nMenu","steps":[{"cmd":"GET LAMP AND SWORD","reply":" lamp: Taken. sword: Taken.   > ","room":231,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":23,"n":"sword","before":{"n":"sword","p":231,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"sword","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":76,"n":"lamp","before":{"n":"lamp","p":231,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"lamp","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Narrow Tunnel You are standing at the southern end of a narrow tunnel where it opens into a wide cavern. The cavern is dimly illuminated by phosphorescent mosses clinging to its high ceiling. A deep ravine winds through the cavern, with a small stream at the bottom. The walls of the ravine are steep and crumbly. A foot bridge crosses the ravine to the south.   > ","room":229,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":231,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":229,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Foot Bridge You are standing on a crude but sturdy wooden foot bridge crossing a deep ravine. The path runs north and south from here.   > ","room":228,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":229,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":228,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Great Cavern This is the center of the great cavern, carved out of the limestone. Stalactites and stalagmites of many sizes are everywhere. The room glows with dim light provided by phosphorescent moss, and weird shadows move all around you. A narrow path winds southwest among the stalagmites, and another leads northeast. A strange little man in a long cloak appears suddenly in the room. He is wearing a high pointed hat embroidered with astrological signs. He has a long, stringy, and unkempt beard. The Wizard draws forth his wand and waves it in your direction. It begins to glow with a faint ","room":226,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":228,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":226,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" You have moved into a dark place. It is pitch black. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.   > ","room":225,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":226,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":225,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"LIGHT LAMP","reply":" The lamp is now on.   Dark Tunnel This is a dark tunnel with dim light to the northeast. The tunnel is smooth but dusty and filled with twigs and leaves, debris which becomes deeper as the tunnel branches into a wide corridor leading southwest and a narrower one leading southeast.   > ","room":225,"player":4,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"SE","reply":" North End of Garden This is the northern end of a formal garden. Hedges hide the cavern walls, and if you don't look up, the illusion is of a cloudy day outside. The light comes from a large growth of glowing mosses on the roof of the cave. A break in the hedge is almost overgrown to the north. A carefully manicured path leads south. In the center of a rosebed is a small open structure, painted white. It appears to be a gazebo.   > ","room":222,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":225,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":222,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"ENTER GAZEBO","reply":" Gazebo This is a gazebo in the midst of a formal garden. It is cool and restful here. A tea table adorns the center of the gazebo. Sitting on the table is:    A matchbook   A china teapot   A place mat   A newspaper   A letter opener A unicorn is peacefully cropping grass at the north end of the garden. There is something hanging around its neck. Your sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.   > ","room":220,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":222,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":220,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":223,"n":"unicorn","before":{"n":"unicorn","p":0,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"unicorn","p":222,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET TEAPOT, MAT, LETTER OPENER, MATCHBOOK AND PAPER","reply":" china teapot: Taken. place mat: Taken. letter opener: Taken. matchbook: Taken. newspaper: Taken.   > ","room":220,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":32,"n":"china teapot","before":{"n":"china teapot","p":104,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"china teapot","p":4,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}},{"id":33,"n":"place mat","before":{"n":"place mat","p":104,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"place mat","p":4,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}},{"id":34,"n":"newspaper","before":{"n":"newspaper","p":104,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"newspaper","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":37,"n":"letter opener","before":{"n":"letter opener","p":104,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"letter opener","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":105,"n":"matchbook","before":{"n":"matchbook","p":104,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"matchbook","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"OUT","reply":" North End of Garden There is a beautiful unicorn here cropping grass. The unicorn bounds lightly away. Your sword is no longer glowing.   > ","room":222,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":220,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":222,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":223,"n":"unicorn","before":{"n":"unicorn","p":222,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"unicorn","p":0,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Formal Garden This is the middle part of a formal garden. Hedges hide the cavern walls and a dim illumination comes from mosses far above. The path is of small crushed white stones. It winds among bushes and flower beds from south to north. To the north a small structure can be seen. To the south are peculiarly shaped bushes. There is a small gap in the hedges to the west. A unicorn is peacefully cropping grass at the north end of the garden. There is something hanging around its neck. Your sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.   > ","room":219,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":222,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":219,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":223,"n":"unicorn","before":{"n":"unicorn","p":0,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"unicorn","p":222,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"W","reply":" Path Near Stream The path follows the south edge of a deep ravine and heads northeast. A tunnel heads southwest, narrowing to a rather tight crawl. A faint whirring sound can be heard in that direction. On the east is a ruined archway choked with vegetation. Your sword is no longer glowing.   > ","room":216,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":219,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":223,"n":"unicorn","before":{"n":"unicorn","p":222,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"unicorn","p":0,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"SW","reply":" Carousel Room You are in a large circular room whose high ceiling is lost in gloom. Eight identical passages leave the room. A loud whirring sound comes from all around, and you feel sort of disoriented in here.   > ","room":138,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":216,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":138,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" You're not sure which direction is which. This room is very disorienting.   Topiary This is the southern end of a formal garden. Hedges hide the cavern walls and mosses provide dim illumination. Fantastically shaped hedges and bushes are arrayed with geometric precision. They have not recently been clipped, but you can discern creatures in the shapes of the bushes: There is a dragon, a unicorn, a great serpent, a huge misshapen dog, and several human figures. On the west side of the garden the path leads through a rose arbor into a tunnel.   > ","room":218,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":138,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":218,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"W","reply":" Carousel Room   > ","room"