rance to a well-constructed but somewhat ruined hall.   > ","room":214,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":215,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":214,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"FILL POT WITH WATER","reply":" The teapot is now full of water.   > ","room":214,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":31,"n":"quantity of water","before":{"n":"quantity of water","p":0,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"quantity of water","p":32,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Ledge in Ravine You are on a narrow ledge near the bottom of a deep ravine. The ledge continues to the west. A precarious climb up to another tiny ledge is possible. A short scramble down the rock face leads to a stream.   > ","room":213,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":214,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":213,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"U","reply":" Tiny Room This is a tiny room carved out of the wall of the ravine. There is an exit down a precarious climb. On the north side of the room is a massive wooden door, which has a small window barred with iron. A formidable bolt lock is set within the door frame. A keyhole covered by a thin metal lid lies within the lock.   > ","room":100,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":213,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":100,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"OPEN LID","reply":" The lid is now open.   > ","room":100,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":43,"n":"metal lid","before":{"n":"metal lid","p":100,"c":1,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"metal lid","p":100,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"PUT MAT UNDER DOOR","reply":" The place mat fits easily under the door.   > ","room":100,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":33,"n":"place mat","before":{"n":"place mat","p":4,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0},"after":{"n":"place mat","p":100,"c":1,"o":1,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"PUT OPENER IN KEYHOLE","reply":" There is a faint noise from behind the door and a small cloud of dust rises from beneath it. Done.   > ","room":100,