er dreary room, eerily illuminated by a red glow emanating from a crack in one wall. The light falls upon a dusty wooden table in the center of the room. On the south side of the room is a massive wooden door, which has a small window barred with iron. A formidable bolt lock is set within the door frame. A keyhole lies within the lock. In the center of the table sits a blue crystal sphere.   > ","room":103,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":100,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":103,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET BLUE SPHERE","reply":" Taken.   > ","room":103,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":35,"n":"blue crystal sphere","before":{"n":"blue crystal sphere","p":103,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"blue crystal sphere","p":4,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Tiny Room There is a rusty iron key here. There is a place mat here. There is a letter opener here.   > ","room":100,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":103,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":100,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"D","reply":" Ledge in Ravine   > ","room":213,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":100,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":213,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"CLOSE DOOR","reply":" You can't see any door here!   > ","room":213,"player":4,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"OPEN DOOR","reply":" You can't see any door here!   > ","room":213,"player":4,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"OPEN SWORD","reply":" You must tell me how to do that to a sword.   > ","room":213,"player":4,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"W","reply":" End of Ledge A ledge from the east ends here, and a tunnel leads north into the wall. There is a rather odd smokey odor in the warm air of the tunnel. Your sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.   > ","room":212,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":213,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":212,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"N","reply":" Dragon Room The room is a large cavern full of broken stone. The walls are scorched and there are deep scratches on the floor. A sooty dry smell is very strong here. A paved path winds from a large passage to the west, through the room, and across a huge stone bridge to the south. To the east a small crack is visible. A dark and smokey tunnel leads north. A huge red dragon is lying here, blocking the entrance to a tunnel leading north. Smoke curls from his nostrils and out between his teeth. Your sword has begun to glow very brightly.   > ","room":211,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":212,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":211,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"HIT DRAGON WITH SWORD","reply":" That captured his interest. He stares at you balefully. The dragon continues to watch you carefully.   > ","room":211,"player":4,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"S","reply":" Stone Bridge This is the middle of a ruined but still impressive stone bridge spanning a deep chasm. Water flows far beneath. A paved path leads north into a large open space. To the south, the path leads into a misty tunnel. The dragon follows you, out of mingled curiosity and anger.   > ","room":202,"player":4,"diff":[{"id":4,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":211,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":207,"n":"huge red dragon","before":{"n":"huge red dragon","p":211,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"huge red dragon","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]}],"final":{"count":250,"o":{"1":{"n":"pair of hands","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"2":{"n":"zorkmid","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"3":{"n":"way","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"4":{"n":"cretin","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"5":{"n":"you","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"6":{"n":"blast of air","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"7":{"n":"lurking grue","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"8":{"n":"ground","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"9":{"n":"sailor","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"10":{"n":"blessings","p":243,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"11":{"n":"such thing","p":0,"c":0,